,"shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"u0U5IQEQzQauLnP54rMUOA","review_id":"Aq1LPyAkyrW3GnD0yg4jzQ","date":"2016-04-15T16:46:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9440740942955017,"text_excerpt":"During my short visit to New Orleans, I was desparate to find a place that would have better coffee than the one at my hotel. Thankfully the husband suggested I go get my coffee addiction fix by paying Addiction a visit. So fitting ay? I kept walkings the shop looking for their giant coffee heads window picture I had seen on Yelp but sadly it is no longer there. Found it, walked in and found that this place has a nice chill vibe to it. I ordered a latte and took the last muffin that they had that day, a carrot flavored one. The muffin was delicious and the latte was amazing!! Great way to start my day and great way to start my mini vacay. Needless to say I went back to this place again. T..."},{"business_id":"u0U5IQEQzQauLnP54rMUOA","review_id":"LqMjVYbmJCQK0LQ1gzYGaQ","date":"2016-11-23T14:49:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9426563382148743,"text_excerpt":"I book marked this place to try. For some reason, the Yelp map shows them near the Museum of Death...a sign of caffeine addiction? LOL! But once you find it, it's a hidden gem. Great space to relax or work. Simple menu. Since you can get the usual at any coffee house, I thought I'd try something different. I ordered Miss Tracy's Addiction...two shots of espresso, steamed coconut and regular milk, honey, simple syrup and a dash of cayenne....hot and spicy that left my mouth on fire. It is a unique flavor that I couldn't get enough of! I got my friend Two Black Eyes...LOL! Two shots of espresso and drip coffee. I also bought a pound of ground coffee. This is really a great little place. Fri..."},{"business_id":"u0U5IQEQzQauLnP54rMUOA","review_id":"NhlQI66uMZM-xb8g7vwzhA","date":"2016-07-08T16:19:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9396671652793884,"text_excerpt":"This place is super good! Really neat wood tables, great specialty coffee drinks, and friendly employees! I love the Miss Tracy's Addiction, which has honey and cayenne pepper with espresso, but they have \"normal\" coffee drinks too."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"u0U5IQEQzQauLnP54rMUOA","photo_id":"3OQAGLjOD2dvLl3j57gJCw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/3OQAGLjOD2dvLl3j57gJCw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9497042298316956},{"business_id":"u0U5IQEQzQauLnP54rMUOA","photo_id":"rxMTe7RFlMNZozty1j7RIw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/rxMTe7RFlMNZozty1j7RIw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8822491765022278},{"business_id":"u0U5IQEQzQauLnP54rMUOA","photo_id":"N77IytPjXNDpMUFVogJklg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/N77IytPjXNDpMUFVogJklg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8658041954040527},{"business_id":"u0U5IQEQzQauLnP54rMUOA","photo_id":"CZt1JBirkAldoRkZRpyWlA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CZt1JBirkAldoRkZRpyWlA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8111293315887451},{"business_id":"u0U5IQEQzQauLnP54rMUOA","photo_id":"Ztpql1rkgx5TzYddZSEP3w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ztpql1rkgx5TzYddZSEP3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7872368693351746}]},"notebook_case":null}
